        "message": "Hi {{ $json.passenger_name }},\n\nThis is a reminder that your flight {{ $json.flight_number }} ({{ $json.origin }} to {{ $json.destination }}) departs at {{ $json.local_departure_display }} (UTC).\n\nPlease complete online check-in before you arrive at the airport.\n\nSafe travels,\nFlight Management Team",
